WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:06.297 --> 00:00:06.880
[Air horn sounds]

00:00:06.931 --> 00:00:08.208
[Jennifer gasps, screams]

00:00:08.258 --> 00:00:10.910
JENNIFER WALTERS
Whoa, Jesus! What the hell, man?

00:00:10.961 --> 00:00:12.434
BRUCE BANNER
Still in control, no overwhelming

00:00:12.484 --> 00:00:13.305
feelings of rage?

00:00:13.356 --> 00:00:15.395
JENNIFER WALTERS
No! A normal amount of rage!

00:00:15.445 --> 00:00:17.067
BRUCE BANNER
You do revert back to Jen-form

00:00:17.117 --> 00:00:17.805
when you sleep.

00:00:17.856 --> 00:00:19.622
JENNIFER WALTERS
Was the air horn really necessary?

00:00:19.672 --> 00:00:21.522
BRUCE BANNER
For comedy, absolutely.

00:00:21.573 --> 00:00:22.583
♪♪

00:00:22.633 --> 00:00:24.680
BRUCE BANNER
This is a multi-year journey

00:00:24.731 --> 00:00:26.464
you're about to embark on.

00:00:28.633 --> 00:00:30.164
JENNIFER WALTERS
Yes! Woo!

00:00:30.429 --> 00:00:31.692
BRUCE BANNER
Who's your best friend?

00:00:31.742 --> 00:00:32.332
JENNIFER WALTERS
Nikki.

00:00:32.382 --> 00:00:34.243
BRUCE BANNER
[Buzzer sound] Spandex.

00:00:34.293 --> 00:00:36.286
Spandex is your best friend.

00:00:37.067 --> 00:00:39.436
Being a Hulk asks for balance.

00:00:43.215 --> 00:00:45.426
You have so much more to learn.

00:00:48.934 --> 00:00:49.650
Yes!

00:00:50.381 --> 00:00:51.634
JENNIFER WALTERS
I'm clearly nailing it at

00:00:51.684 --> 00:00:52.803
all of these things.

00:00:54.968 --> 00:00:55.817
BRUCE BANNER
If you want to go back to your

00:00:55.867 --> 00:00:58.267
life as a lawyer, 
I respect that.

00:00:59.031 --> 00:00:59.977
JENNIFER WALTERS
He doesn't mean that.

00:01:01.677 --> 00:01:05.317
♪♪

00:01:06.258 --> 00:01:07.966
HOLDEN HOLLOWAY
More and more eccentric super humans

00:01:08.016 --> 00:01:09.236
are coming out of the woodwork.

00:01:11.857 --> 00:01:12.835
[Laughing]

00:01:12.885 --> 00:01:14.915
HOLDEN HOLLOWAY
We are going to launch a division for them,

00:01:14.966 --> 00:01:17.311
and I want the She-Hulk
to be the face of it.

00:01:18.299 --> 00:01:19.104
EMIL BLONSKY
Jennifer Walters...

00:01:20.643 --> 00:01:21.518
...namaste?

00:01:22.463 --> 00:01:24.077
JENNIFER WALTERS
I have a serious conflict of interest.

00:01:24.127 --> 00:01:26.178
This man tried to kill my cousin Bruce.

00:01:26.306 --> 00:01:27.710
HOLDEN HOLLOWAY
Yeah, that's quite alright.

00:01:27.760 --> 00:01:28.380
JENNIFER WALTERS
Oh.

00:01:29.854 --> 00:01:32.557
People only care because
I'm representing Emil Blonsky.

00:01:32.615 --> 00:01:33.890
NIKKI RAMOS
I think they care because they're like,

00:01:33.940 --> 00:01:35.779
"Hey, that girl's green!"

00:01:36.795 --> 00:01:38.155
[Crowd screaming]

00:01:38.620 --> 00:01:39.573
NIKKI RAMOS
Jen, do your thing.

00:01:39.624 --> 00:01:40.984
JENNIFER WALTERS
God, I really like this outfit.

00:01:47.373 --> 00:01:48.600
JENNIFER WALTERS
I'm not proud of this.

00:01:48.654 --> 00:01:49.474
♪♪

00:01:51.202 --> 00:01:53.980
WONG
Ms. Walters, we answer to a higher power.

00:01:54.030 --> 00:01:56.830
Our universe is on
the edge of a precipice.

00:01:58.084 --> 00:02:00.804
JENNIFER WALTERS
I am a lawyer. We do things by the book.

00:02:00.951 --> 00:02:02.780
WONG
Mhm... The Book of Vishanti?

00:02:02.927 --> 00:02:06.314
JENNIFER WALTERS
No, the book of American, uh, laws.

00:02:06.365 --> 00:02:07.310
[Groan]

00:02:08.654 --> 00:02:09.971
BRUCE BANNER
Whether you like it or not,

00:02:10.021 --> 00:02:11.701
you're now a Super Hero.

00:02:11.944 --> 00:02:12.565
JENNIFER WALTERS
Let's do this.

00:02:15.882 --> 00:02:17.349
JENNIFER WALTERS
You know that friend you had in

00:02:17.399 --> 00:02:18.069
high school?

00:02:18.960 --> 00:02:22.965
Who was way cooler than you were,
attractive, got all the attention

00:02:23.015 --> 00:02:23.882
from everyone?

00:02:25.726 --> 00:02:26.726
Hello!

00:02:27.694 --> 00:02:29.222
BRUCE BANNER
I think I'm jealous.

00:02:29.272 --> 00:02:30.194
Is that what I'm feeling?

00:02:30.245 --> 00:02:32.077
♪♪

